{
  "header": ["The page's extended plan for N64Recomp-browser's tools/play_page.mjs, at most 5 minutes with every timeout counted,",
             "for when a longer play than the regular one (tools/play_plan.json) is needed: the launcher, Load ROM once the shader",
             "list Chrome builds behind it is done (Firefox builds none there, and its line saying so is the one waited for), Start",
             "Game, the logos and the start of the DK Rap; then the main menu, which Start in the Rap reaches, and four levels in",
             "one game, each started by tools/shader_survey.js's surveyMap (from the main menu the game starts on file 3 there, in",
             "play it warps as a loading zone does), each a need that fails the run unless the game is in adventure mode on the map",
             "asked for: Jungle Japes as DK, about 45 s of DK walking in from the level's entrance and then to and fro, jumping,",
             "attacking and turning the camera, clear of the entrance's portal, which leaves the level; then Angry Aztec's desert as",
             "Diddy, Gloomy Galleon's harbour as Tiny and Creepy Castle at night as Diddy, each its first visit's flyover (12 s) and",
             "then about 20 s of the shader plan's walk out and back about where the Kong lands, jumps, attacks, Z with C-down and",
             "with B and the camera turned. Each level has a shot, Japes' about 8 s in and the others' about 5 s after the flyover.",
             "Its waits and holds in the levels are on the game's own clock, shader_survey.js's gameTime() (60ths), so every browser",
             "walks the Kongs as far whatever frames it gives the game; the last step reads where the Kong is (gPlayerPointer)."],
